micros←toTime hmsu;v
⍝ Convert (hour min sec micros) -> duckdb_time micros.
⍝ Avoid ABI-sensitive struct-by-value FFI on Windows.

v←,hmsu
:If 4≠≢v
    micros←0
    →0
:EndIf

h m s u←v
:If (h<0)∨h>23∨m<0∨m>59∨s<0∨s>59∨u<0
    micros←0
    →0
:EndIf

micros←h×3600
micros+←m×60
micros+←s
micros×←1000000
micros+←u
